# Play test of Shellback (CIPlay shellback, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the tail beach at 0 -82;
# the Sea shrine at -64 -62 and its flooded cave on the sea floor at -88 -86 (floor -11 m, the air pocket under its roof);
# the Sky shrine's needle at 58 46 (ledges 8 m and 14.5 m, top 21 m, the ladders at x 58, z 35.8 / 39.7 / 43.7); the
# ramp up to the plateau from 22 -68 to 40 -57 (10.9 m), the Tusk ring at 62 -50; the Wing shrine's pen at -50 50
# (2.6 m, its gate on the east side at z 44.5..47.5); the pass over the neck ridge (-9 47 up to 9 50, 10.5 m) and the
# ridge path north to the head-temple's terrace at 13 76 (10.5 m), its gate at 13 72.5
island Shellback
expect step 0
expect title The Four Scutes
expect animals Turtle 4
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden tuskchest
wait 5

# The tail beach: the tablet, the canoe's box
walk 6 -86 to 1 -81 h=1.5
zone tailbeach
expect step 0
read The Shell-keepers' tablet
expect step 1
open Canoe box

# The Sea shrine: the dive into the flooded cave, its air pocket, the scute's chest
walk -56 -56 to -62 -60.5 h=1.2
zone diveshrine
expect step 2
air seaair
open The Sea shrine's scute
expect story scute 1
expect step 3

# The Sky shrine: up the needle's ladders, ledge by ledge, to the nest on top
walk 58 29 to 58 34.5 h=3
zone climbshrine
expect step 4
climb 58 35.8 h=2.8
climb 58 35.8 h=5.22
climb 58 35.8 h=7.64
expect stand 57 38.8 h=8 below=10
climb 58 39.7 h=8
climb 58 39.7 h=10.42
climb 58 39.7 h=12.84
expect stand 57 42.8 h=14.5 below=16
open Ledge box
climb 58 43.7 h=14.5
climb 58 43.7 h=16.92
climb 58 43.7 h=19.34
expect stand 57 46.6 h=21 below=23
use skynest
expect story scute 2
expect step 5

# The Tusk shrine: up the ramp onto the plateau, into the ring; the boars; the stone chest
walk 22 -68 to 31 -62.5 to 40 -57 to 55 -52 h=10.9
zone fightshrine
expect step 6
kill Warthog
expect step 7
expect shown tuskchest
open The Tusk shrine's scute
expect story scute 3
expect step 8

# The Wing shrine: the keeper-box is shut till the hens are home; the net basket; the hens caught
walk -40 46 to -45.5 46 h=2.6
zone catchshrine
expect step 9
open The Wing shrine's scute
expect message BRING HOME HER HENS
open The keepers' net basket
catch Chicken 3
expect step 10
open The Wing shrine's scute
expect story scute 4
expect step 11

# The head-temple: over the pass and along the ridge; the sockets refused till the carving is read; the gate; the treasure
walk -9 47 to 9 50 to 13 51 to 13 66 h=10.5
zone headtemple
expect step 11
use sockets
expect message Read the carving
read The head-temple's carving
expect step 12
use sockets
wait 7
walk 13 70 to 13 76 h=10.5
zone sanctum
expect step 13
open The Tortoise's treasure
expect done
